  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ONE HEALTH Programme Fund: Mitigating Health Threats in the Food and Agriculture Sectors through a One Health Approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is expected to contribute to ONE HEALTH: Sustainable and resilient agri?food systems built to address threats that relate to the health of humans, animals, plants and eco-systems.
The impact of this programme is to strengthen national and international One Health systems through early warning, risk reduction and the progressive management of emerging and endemic zoonoses threats, high impact animal and plant pests and diseases (APPDs) including those with epidemic and pandemic potential, and AMR.</narrative>
  </description>
